#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/account/gis-account-page-enterprise.ui:13
msgid ""
"Enterprise login allows an existing centrally managed user account to be "
"used on this device. You can also use this account to access company "
"resources on the internet."
msgstr ""
"Pwede kang gumamit ng kasalukuyang centrally managed na account ng user sa "
"device na ito sa pamamagitan ng login pang-enterprise. Pwede mo ring gamitin "
"ang account na ito para maka-access ng resources ng kompanya sa internet."

